  "notes": "{叩|たた}く means to hit, knock, or beat. A transitive godan verb with both physical and figurative uses.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦ドア→ドア：00773_doa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{叩|たた}く: to knock on a door\n- ⟦{太鼓|たいこ}→太鼓：04049_taiko⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{叩|たた}く: to beat a drum\n- ⟦{肩|かた}→肩：02192_kata⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{叩|たた}く: to pat on the shoulder\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{叩|たた}く: to clap hands\n- ⟦キーボード→キーボード：04410_kiiboodo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{叩|たた}く: to type (lit. hit the keyboard)\n\nUSAGE:\n{叩|たた}く can mean \"to criticize harshly\":\n- ⟦マスコミ→マスコミ：03872_masukomi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{叩|たた}かれる: to be attacked by media\n- ⟦ネット→ネット：05279_netto⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{叩|たた}かれる: to be criticized online\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No common intransitive pair.",
